Swarmbly LCE (Local Cognitive Extension)
========================================

Copyright (C) 2026 Sebastián A. Espinoza-Ulloa (Independent Researcher)

Contact: sebas_saeu@hotmail.com

This repository contains the design documents of the Local Cognitive Extension
for the Swarmbly protocol: a local-first layer in which each user keeps a
human-readable memory anchored to their own sources and a lightweight adapter
that learns only behavioural patterns, with optional on-demand exchange of
small signed knowledge capsules between nodes. Swarmbly itself fragments the
*problem* rather than the *model* and is published separately at
https://github.com/Sebastardito/Swarmbly-AI.

Components at the time of this notice:
  - Whitepaper LCE              v0.1 (draft, Spanish; English pending)
  - Specification LCE           v0.1 (draft, Spanish)
  - SWIP-XXXX                   revision 2 (draft, English)
  - Annotated bibliography      compiled 2026-10-04
  - Reference implementation    not yet started

